# pagevet 0.1.0  HTTP status errors  started 2026-08-14T11:02:30Z
# Main-document responses whose FINAL status is outside the acceptable
# band (200-399). Intermediate 3xx hops are listed, not counted as errors.

#0002  https://example.com/missing
       status   404 Not Found outcome=http_error
       final    https://www.example.com/missing
       remote   127.0.0.1:PORT  http/1.1
       redirect 2 hop(s)
                1. 301  https://example.com/missing
                2. 302  https://example.com/moved

#0007  https://shop.example.com/checkout?step=2&ref=nav
       status   500 Internal Server Error  outcome=http_error
